abstract: >-
  RUPA is research software for configurable differentially private release of
  fixed-roster industrial microdata, with a controlled default row-release path
  and separate public/synthetic-only aggregate and reconstruction research tools.
keywords:
  - differential privacy
  - industrial data
  - privacy budget allocation
  - research software
